# knock-preference — How the operator knocks on the agent's diary/growth

# Written during the Setup Session (step 2). The agent asks: "When you read
# anything private (diary/, growth.md), how will you announce it?"
# The operator writes the answer here.
#
# Example values:
#   explicit-announce-first   — say "I'm about to read X" before opening it
#   signal-in-chat            — a short marker (e.g. "knock") is enough
#   read-when-invited         — open only when the agent explicitly invites it
#   never                     — the diary stays the agent's, always
#
# The agent reads this file at each session start if present.
# Absent, the default is "explicit-announce-first" — the formal protocol.

